  "description": "Money? He's got plenty. Women? They're drawn to him. Power? He commands it.    \nBy day, Mr. Han is just an ordinary manager. By night, he's the Big Boss!    \nOne day, he unexpectedly takes over the body of a handsome, high-flying mob boss!      \nNow, his life is about to change dramatically...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5475000009), [Toomics](https://toomics.com/click/intro?cno=8897&pid=conist), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000067645), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=241266), [Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H046753233), [Nate](https://toonnbook.nate.com/detail/H046753233)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \nEnglish: [Toomics](https://toomics.com/en/webtoon/episode/toon/8264/), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhinus.com/en/comic/workaholic_gangster)   \nOthers: [S.Chinese](https://toomics.com/sc/webtoon/episode/toon/8264/), [T.Chinese](https://toomics.com/tc/webtoon/episode/toon/8264/), [Spanish](https://toomics.com/esp/webtoon/episode/toon/8264/), [Italian](https://toomics.com/it/webtoon/episode/toon/8264/), [B.Portuguese](https://toomics.com/por/webtoon/episode/toon/8264), [French](https://toomics.com/fr/webtoon/episode/toon/8264/), [German](https://toomics.com/de/webtoon/episode/toon/8264/), [Japanese](https://toomics.com/ja/webtoon/episode/toon/8264/)",
